    "title": "Check For Understanding",
    "long_instructions": "Think about one specific styling change you made to improve your page. Write 1–2 sentences explaining how you refined your prompt and how the final change better reflects your brand and improves usability using this sentence frame:\r\n\r\n> I improved my design by ... This helped my page by ...",
    "stay_on_level_after_submit": "false",
